{"data":"{\"thinking\":{\"type\":\"adaptive\"},\"stream\":true,\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Read text with one-based inclusive start_line/end_line. Optional max_bytes bounds the read; job reports cap inline output and preserve the full result on disk.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"end_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]},\"name\":\"read_file\"},{\"description\":\"List immediate entries, sorted by name; directories end with /.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]},\"name\":\"list_directory\"},{\"description\":\"Search files recursively using a regular expression. context_lines defaults to zero. Output uses grep path:line:text and path-line-context with merged windows.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"context_lines\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"pattern\"]},\"name\":\"search_files\"},{\"description\":\"Write text, creating parent directories. Existing files require overwrite:true unless append:true. Append preserves existing content.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"content\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"overwrite\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"append\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"content\"]},\"name\":\"write_file\"},{\"description\":\"Replace one exact, unique old_text anchor with new_text. Zero or multiple matches refuse without changing the file; read and provide a more specific anchor.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"old_text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"new_text\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"old_text\",\"new_text\"]},\"name\":\"edit_file\"},{\"description\":\"Start a fresh /bin/sh in a PTY. cwd applies only to this call, relative to the workspace. Merged output and exit_code stay on disk; a running report is a handle, not cancellation. ai_callback_delay is seconds (default 3); pattern matches unseen output; max_output_bytes defaults to 16384.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"command\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"cwd\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"command\"]},\"name\":\"run_command\"},{\"description\":\"Wait for a job, including a finished job. Return only unseen output; waiting does not stop execution.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\"]},\"name\":\"wait_for_job\"},{\"description\":\"Send a line of input to a running PTY job, then wait. A missing trailing newline is added.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"input\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\",\"input\"]},\"name\":\"send_input\"},{\"description\":\"Kill a job's process group. Go-only work is marked killed but its goroutine cannot be stopped.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\"]},\"name\":\"kill_job\"},{\"description\":\"Set one-shot wait/output limits for the very next call, whichever tool it is. That call reports consumption; explicit call arguments override these limits.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"ai_callback_delay\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Seconds before looking again, default 3; never a job deadline\"},\"ai_callback_pattern\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Regex on unseen output\"},\"max_output_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Inline output byte cap, default 16384\"}},\"required\":[]},\"name\":\"tool_limits\"}],\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\"max_tokens\":4096,\"system\":\"You are a helpful assistant built from raw HTTP calls in Chapter 1 of The Art of Building AI Coding Agents. Answer briefly.\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Write a vivid 70-word story about a lighthouse keeper who collects fog.\"}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"signature\":\"\",\"thinking\":\"The user wants a creative writing piece - a 70-word story about a lighthouse keeper who collects fog. No tools needed here, just creative writing.\",\"type\":\"thinking\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"# The Fog Collector\\n\\nEvery dawn, Maren climbed down to the shore with her glass jars, wide-mouthed and hungry. She'd sweep them through the silver air, sealing wisps of fog before the sun could steal them. Each jar held a different morning — some cold and briny, others soft as wool. Visitors called her peculiar. But on clear, breathless nights, she'd uncork a lid and let the mist curl out, remembering the sea.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Use run_command to print STREAM_PROBE, then tell me the result in one sentence.\"}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"signature\":\"\",\"thinking\":\"The user wants me to run a command to print \\\"STREAM_PROBE\\\".\",\"type\":\"thinking\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_013geispE6puJh6SFQj1yeGa\",\"name\":\"run_command\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"echo STREAM_PROBE\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_013geispE6puJh6SFQj1yeGa\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"STREAM_PROBE\\n\\nexit_code: 0\\n\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What exact word did the command print? Answer in one sentence.\"}]}]}","event":"request"}
